*----------------------------------------------------------
* mission1jimmy.s — Jimmy color-shifted sprites for Mission 1.
*
* Bank $1D. Loaded by game.s at boot to $1D:$0000. All blocks
* are generated by tools/generate_jimmy_blocks.py from the Billy
* originals in mission1.s + mission12.s — palette mapping
*   $A → $F   (Billy's darker blue → red)
*   $9 → $1   (highlight → white)
* All other nibbles preserved.
*
* Compiled-pipeline blocks emit DATA + MASK + DATA_MIRROR +
* MASK_MIRROR — masks are copied byte-for-byte from Billy's
* (transparency is identical), so the renderer's single-bank
* read path works without engine changes.
*----------------------------------------------------------

         ORG $1D0000

*----------------------------------------------------------
* Header — init_jimmy reads spr_addr_off at $1D:$0000 to
* find the sprite-address table, then copies each 2-byte
* entry into the corresponding bank-$00 cache var.
*----------------------------------------------------------
spr_addr_off  dw spr_addr_tbl

*----------------------------------------------------------
* Sprite address table — init_jimmy walks this sequentially
* and patches the matching `spr_jimmyXX_*` cache var in
* bank $00. Order must match game.s's init_jimmy loader.
*
* Compiled sprites contribute 4 entries (DATA / MASK /
* DATA_MIRROR / MASK_MIRROR); legacy sprites contribute 1.
*----------------------------------------------------------
spr_addr_tbl
* Walk frames (compiled — IMAGE01/02/03 equivalents).
 dw JIMMY01_DATA, JIMMY01_MASK
 dw JIMMY01_DATA_MIRROR, JIMMY01_MASK_MIRROR
 dw JIMMY02_DATA, JIMMY02_MASK
 dw JIMMY02_DATA_MIRROR, JIMMY02_MASK_MIRROR
 dw JIMMY03_DATA, JIMMY03_MASK
 dw JIMMY03_DATA_MIRROR, JIMMY03_MASK_MIRROR

*----------------------------------------------------------
* Sprite pixel data. Each compiled block is DATA + MASK +
* DATA_MIRROR + MASK_MIRROR; legacy blocks are a single
* hex run. All generated by tools/generate_jimmy_blocks.py
* from Billy originals.
*----------------------------------------------------------

